{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415479","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415479","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041547901:1":{"text":"정말 좋은 곳이네. 음악이 있었다면 더 좋았을 텐데.","source_cn":"这儿真是个好地方，要是再来点音乐就更好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE89833AF984B83D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041547902:1":{"text":"라이카, 여행에서 겪은 재미있는 얘기해 줄까? 음악에 맞춰서 말이야!","source_cn":"莱卡，你想不想听我讲讲旅行中遇到的趣事？正好配上音乐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58FF6B64C87EB3BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041547903:1":{"text":"조금 전에 자극적인 음료를 꽤 많이 마신 것 같던데, 음이탈 나지 않을 자신 있어?","source_cn":"你刚刚喝了不少刺激性饮料，现在唱歌不会跑调吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E8B191DD8352FA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041547904:1":{"text":"너 어렸을 때, 발효된 이슬을 샘물로 착각해서 한 번에 반병을 다 마시고 옥상으로 올라가서 노래 불렀잖아.","source_cn":"还记得小时候，有一次你错把发酵的露酿当成山泉饮，一口气...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB69A360089673BDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041547905:1":{"text":"그때 부른 노랜 정말...","source_cn":"那首歌唱得实在是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF34DD5A075FF7864","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041547906:1":{"text":"그, 그런 일이 있었어?! 왜 기억이 하나도 안 나지?!","source_cn":"还、还有这种事？！我怎么一点都不记得？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x820D5E0F1C093FA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041547907:1":{"text":"부르다 잠들었으니 기억이 안 날 수밖에.","source_cn":"你只唱到一半就睡着了，当然没印象。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5E7EFC719AD684D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041547908:1":{"text":"다프니 할머니께서 제때 발견해서 급속 성장 덩굴로 널 받쳐주지 않으셨더라면 넌 분명 지붕에서 굴러떨어져서 땅바닥에 내동댕이 처졌을 거야.","source_cn":"要不是达赫妮婆婆及时发现，用速生藤托住了你，你肯定会顺...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAF99F8020835609","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041547909:1":{"text":"나중에 아든 현자님께서 달빛호수 마을에 오셨을 때, 할머니께 노래 부른 사람이 누구길래 음을 그렇게 다 틀리냐고 물어보시기까지 하셨다니까?","source_cn":"后来雅顿贤者来月湖村时，还问婆婆那天唱歌的人是谁，怎么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA05463C23D66E2C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041547910:1":{"text":"뭐라고?! 어르신까지 들으셨다니... 이미지가 완전 망가져버렸네...!","source_cn":"什么？！连老爷子也听到了……我的形象全毁了……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA49FC88883AF9E94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041547911:1":{"text":"그때 넌 아직 어렸으니까 아든 현자께서는 별로 신경 쓰지 않으실 거야.","source_cn":"那时候你还小呢，雅顿贤者不会往心里去的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3C4F1AB7B691452","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041547912:1":{"text":"최근 여행에 대해 들려줘. 노래로 알려줘도 되고.","source_cn":"给我讲讲你最近的旅行故事吧，用唱歌的方式也可以。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF791C6757100CF3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041547913:1":{"text":"네 음이탈을 들은 지 꽤 돼서 좀 그립기도 하네.","source_cn":"好久没有听到你唱歌跑调了，也有点怀念呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x652BCBD5A6BC3786","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041547914:1":{"text":"이제 절대 그럴 일 없다고!","source_cn":"——我现在绝对不会跑调的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BE4C03C70BD33B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":2}}